 to protect your interests. We back our clients with expert claim negotiation and appraisal representation.</p></div></div></section><section id="commercialBring" class="section no-padding"><div class="_9-column-grid _4-5"><div class="grid-4-9 padding-standard-left"><div class="margin-right-5vw padding-left-standard"><h2 class="no-padding">WHAT you get</h2><h3 class="gray-text secondary-title">A FULL COMMERCIAL ROOFING TEAM &amp;<br/>A COMPREHENSIVE SUITE OF REPORTS</h3><div class="red-line-cushion-box"><div class="red-line-long"></div></div><div class="list-with-heading"><h4 class="list-with-heading-detail"><span class="text-span-4">Commercial roofing executive director</span></h4><h4 class="list-with-heading-detail"><span class="text-span-4">Forensic Engineer</span></h4><h4 class="list-with-heading-detail"><span class="text-span-4">Registered Roof Consultant</span></h4><h4 class="list-with-heading-detail"><span class="text-span-4">Meteorologist</span></h4><h4 class="list-with-heading-detail"><span class="text-span-4">Public Insurance Adjuster</span></h4><h4 class="list-with-heading-detail"><span class="text-span-4">Construction Manager</span></h4><h4 class="list-with-heading-detail"><span class="text-span-4">Installation Team</span></h4></div></div></div><div class="grid-5-9 commercial-bring-image"></div></div></section><section id="commercialSolutions" class="section light-gray-bg full-width"><div class="general-container"><h2 class="h2 centered"><span class="gray-text">Trusted Relationships.</span> <br/>Lasting Solutions.</h2><div class="vertical-list-container mobile commercial"><ol role="list" class="vertical-list w-list-unstyled"><li class="vertical-list-item"><span class="vertical-caps align-left">Discover</span><span class="mobile-hide"> - </span></li><li class="vertical-list-item"><span class="vertical-caps align-left">Advocate</span><span class="mobile-hide"> - </span></li><li class="vertical-list-item"><span class="vertical-caps align-left">Plan</span><s