<div class="collage-hover-image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/681da8853416280608d48c76_Stone%20Coated%20Steel.jpg" alt="" class="hover-img"/></div></div></div><div data-w-id="505f04a3-3863-8a55-3f15-7c1624f979cb" class="collage-outer page-collage"><div class="image-text"><div class="collage-short-detail"><p class="paragraph-59"><span class="text-span-5">A heat-reflective, energy efficient single-ply membrane with exceptional resistance to UV, ozone, and chemical exposure.</span></p></div><div class="collage-title-wrapper"><h3 class="image-title-text product">TPO</h3><div class="red-line-short"></div></div></div><div class="collage-inner residential-collage-2"><img width="Auto" loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/6823520466735b53384d8d16_TPO.jpg" class="front-img"/><div class="collage-overlay-image"></div><div class="collage-hover-image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/682352699c1e2d9972fd84bd_TPO.jpg" alt="" class="hover-img"/></div></div></div><div data-w-id="505f04a3-3863-8a55-3f15-7c1624f979dc" class="collage-outer page-collage"><div class="image-text"><div class="collage-short-detail"><p class="paragraph-59"><span class="text-span-5">A strong layered system for low-slope roofs that outlasts extreme temperatures and UV exposure.</span></p></div><div class="collage-title-wrapper"><h3 class="image-title-text product">MODIFIED BITUMEN</h3><div class="red-line-short"></div></div></div><div class="collage-inner residential-collage-2"><img width="Auto" loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/68235225d60518cc257841ac_Modified%20Bitumen.jpg" class="front-img"/><div class="collage-overlay-image"></div><div class="collage-hover-image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/682352692ac5ddc2ce740daf_Modified%20Bitumen%20(placeholder)(1).jpg" alt="" class="hover-img"/></div></div></div><div data-w-id="505f04a3-3863-8a55-3f15-7c1624f979ed" class="collage-outer page-collage"><div class="image-text"><div class="collage-short-detail"><p class="paragraph-59"><span class="text-span-5">A durable system with an excellent lifespan, popular for its unique aesthetic.</span></p></div><div class="collage-title-wrapper"><h3 class="image-title-text product">METAL</h3><div class="red-line-short"></div></div></div><div class="collage-inner residential-collage-2"><img width="Auto" loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/6823520601e82ec1a13648f2_Metal-Commercial.jpg" class="front-img"/><div class="collage-overlay-image"></div><div class="collage-hover-image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/68235269ee8ccff038843607_Metal-Commercial.jpg" alt="" class="hover-img"/></div></div></div><div class="w-embed w-script"><style>
.collage-outer.page-collage .collage-title-wrapper {
    transition: all ease-in-out 0.2s;
  }
/* Desktop (hover) for screens wider than 568px */
/* @media (min-width: 992px) { */


  .collage-outer.page-collage:hover .collage-title-wrapper {
    bottom: 100%;
  }
/* } */

/* Mobile (focus) for screens 568px and below */
@media (max-width: 991px) {
  
  .collage-outer.page-collage.active .collage-title-wrapper {
    bottom: 100%;
  }
}

</style>
<script>
  document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
    const collages = document.querySelectorAll(".collage-outer.page-collage");

    function isMobile() {
      return window.innerWidth <= 991;
    }

    if (isMobile()) {
      collages.forEach(collage => {
        collage.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
          // Stop event from bubbling to document
          e.stopPropagation();

          // Remove 'active' from all
          collages.forEach(c => c.classList.remove("active"));

          // Add 'active' only to clicked one
          collage.classList.add("active");
        });
      });

      // Click outside: remove 'active' class
      document.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
        // If clicked element is not inside any .collage-outer.page-collage
        if (![...collages].some(c => c.contains(e.target))) {
          collages.forEach(c => c.classList.remove("active"));
        }
      });
    }
  });
</script></div></div></section><section id="residentialCustomers" class="section light-gray-bg hide-overflow residential-testimonials"><div class="div-block-28"><div class="flex-top residential-testimonial-title"><h2 class="align-title-copy"><span class="text-span">Straight from </span><span>our customers</span></h2></div><div class="_2-column-grid no-gap residential-testimonials"><div class="flexbox vertical-flex vertical-center border-right-gray residential"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/61f1902cf74f351751b4f0f7_SR_claimsWithYou_1200.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/61f1902cf74f351751b4f0f7_SR_claimsWithYou_1200-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/61f1902cf74f351751b4f0f7_SR_claimsWithYou_1200-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/61f1902cf74f351751b4f0f7_SR_claimsWithYou_1200.jpg 1200w" alt="" class="image-9"/></div><div class="mobile-swipe-gesture-container"><div class="swipe-gesture" data-w-id="735833de-f377-f158-164e-5df223f333e6" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/623dcf323ee69cdf904fdad8_SR_swipeGesture.json" data-loop="1" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="1.7017016323899747" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div></div><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="slide" class="testimonial-slider-container w-slider" data-autoplay="false" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="true" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="500" data-infinite="true"><div class="testimonial-mask w-slider-mask"><div class="testimonial-slide w-slide"><div class="flexbox vertical-flex vertical-center testimonial-container"><div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="review-info-wrapper"><div class="reviewer-info"><div class="reviewer-title"><div class="reviewer-name">Aaron Wood</div><div class="star-container"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/61ef041cf99534a5bc01579e_SR_star.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="star"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/61ef041cf99534a5bc01579e_SR_star.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="star"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/61ef041cf99534a5bc01579e_SR_star.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="star"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/61ef041cf99534a5bc01579e_SR_star.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="star"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/61ef041cf99534a5bc01579e_SR_star.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="star"/></div></div><div class="reviewer-service-wrapper"><div class="reviewer-service">President</div><div class="reviewer-service-seperator"></div><div class="reviewer-service">Colorado Jet Center</div></div></div></div><div class="w-richtext"><p>The entire process went great! Our management team and owners were definitely satisfied.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-slide w-slide"><div class="flexbox vertical-flex vertical-center testimonial-container"><div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-empty"><div>No items found.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="testimonial-left-arrow w-slider-arrow-left"><div class="w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="testimonial-right-arrow w-slider-arrow-right"><div class="w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div id="originalNav" class="original-nav w-slider-nav w-round"></div></div></div><div class="flex-bottom-copy residential-copy"><div id="testimonailNav" class="testimonial-nav"><div id="testimonailNav" class="slider-nav"><a id="testimonial1" href="#" class="nav-dot active w-inline-block"></a><a id="testimonial2" href="#" class="nav-dot w-inline-block"></a></div><div class="prev-next"><a href="#" class="testimonial-prev-arrow w-inline-block"></a><a href="#" class="testimonial-next-arrow w-inline-block"></a></div></div><a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=salazar+roofing&amp;oq=salazar+roofing&amp;aqs=chrome..69i57j46i175i199l2j0l2j69i60l3.5934j0j7&amp;sourceid=chrome&amp;ie=UTF-8#lrd=0x87b206335ff246e5:0x6602c9418c5a0b7,1,,," target="_blank" class="arrow-link w-inline-block"><div class="tiny-caps gray-text">See all Google reviews</div></a></div></div></section><section id="commercialReplacement" class="section no-horizontal-padding commercial-replacement"><div class="general-container side-cushion"><h2 class="white-text align-center">Commercial Roof <span class="red-text">Replacement</span></h2><p class="align-center">We provide an expansive range of commercial roofing materials.</p><div class="_5-column-grid replacement-grid commercial"><div class="replacement-blurb"><h3 class="replacement-title text-center-h3">EPDM</h3><p>An extremely durable synthetic rubber roofing membrane. An appealing choice for low-slope commercial roofs.</p></div><div class="replacement-blurb"><h3 class="replacement-title text-center-h3">PVC</h3><p>A flexible, thermoplastic membrane. Excellent for exposure to harsh weather characteristics, and resistance to chemicals and industrial pollutants.</p></div><div class="replacement-blurb"><h3 class="replacement-title text-center-h3">TPO</h3><p>A single-ply roofing membrane. Heat-relflective and energy efficient, provides exceptional resistance to ultraviolet, ozone, and chemical exposure.</p></div><div class="replacement-blurb"><h3 class="replacement-title text-center-h3">Modified Bitumen</h3><p>Designed for low-slope and flat roofs. A strong and tough system that defends high temperatures and extreme conditions.</p></div><div class="replacement-blurb"><h3 class="replacement-title text-center-h3">Metal</h3><p>Adaptable for unique architectural design and popular for durability.</p></div></div><div class="residential-materials-mobile"><div data-w-id="03a8e686-b6b0-b868-42e2-b19f66f54d4a" class="drop-down-wrapper first-folder"><div class="dropdown-link-container"><div class="scroll-content"><div data-w-id="03a8e686-b6b0-b868-42e2-b19f66f54d4d" class="scroll-text accordion">See Our materials</div><div data-w-id="03a8e686-b6b0-b868-42e2-b19f66f54d4f" class="scroll-down-arrow accordion w-embed"><svg width="75px" height="75px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 60 30" x="0px" y="0px">
	<path id="scrollDownArrow" fill="none" stroke="#e3e6e5" stroke-width="3" d="M22.9,26.5l7.1,7.1l7.1-7.1"></path>
</svg>

<style>
