</style></div></div></div><div data-w-id="03a8e686-b6b0-b868-42e2-b19f66f54d50" class="dropdowncontainer"><div class="dropdown-list-4"><div class="dropdown-innerlist"><div class="replacement-blurb"><div class="replacement-title text-title">EDPM</div><p>An extremely durable synthetic rubber roofing membrane. An appealing choice for low-slope commercial roofs.</p></div><div class="replacement-blurb"><div class="replacement-title text-title">PVC</div><p>A flexible, thermoplastic membrane. Excellent for exposure to harsh weather characteristics, and resistance to chemicals and industrial pollutants.</p></div><div class="replacement-blurb"><div class="replacement-title text-title">Top</div><p>A single-ply roofing membrane. Heat-relflective and energy efficient, provides exceptional resistance to ultraviolet, ozone, and chemical exposure.</p></div><div class="replacement-blurb"><div class="replacement-title text-title">Modified Bitumen</div><p>Designed for low-slope and flat roofs. A strong and tough system that defends high temperatures and extreme conditions.</p></div><div class="replacement-blurb last-item"><div class="replacement-title text-title">Metal</div><p>Adaptable for unique architectural design and popular for durability.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="commercialGet" class="section-copy light-gray-bg"><div class="_9-column-grid _4-5"><div class="grid-4-9 what-you-get-container"><div class="margin-right-5vw mobile"><div class="no-padding main-title h2">What you Get</div><div class="gray-text secondary-title">An Advocate in Your Corner</div><div class="red-line-cushion-box"><div class="red-line-long"></div></div><p class="what-you-get-text">You’ll have a summary of our findings, a plan for execution, materials overview, and a roadmap for how we’ll keep business interruptions to a minimum during the commercial roofing process in OKC.</p><ul role="list" class="bold-caps-list"><li class="bold-list-item"><strong>METEOROLOGY REPORTS</strong></li><li class="bold-list-item"><strong>FORENSIC ENGINEERING STUDY</strong></li><li class="bold-list-item"><strong>INFRARED MOISTURE SURVEYS</strong></li><li class="bold-list-item"><strong>CIVIL ENGINEERING REPORT</strong></li><li class="bold-list-item"><strong>STRUCTURAL ENGINEERING REPORT</strong></li><li class="bold-list-item"><strong>FORENSIC ENGINEERING REPORTS</strong></li><li class="bold-list-item"><strong>EXPERT ROOF INSPECTION REPORT</strong></li></ul></div></div><div class="grid-5-9 left-border space-between"><div class="general-container what-we-do-container"><div class="text-block-9">What We Do</div><p>We begin every commercial project by completing a full site inspection and assessment of all structures. Our executive Oklahoma commercial roofing team will personally be onsite to photograph, document, and catalog all sustained damages. With extensive forensic, structural, and meteorological data we can troubleshoot problems and tailor a roofing system to your exact needs.</p></div><div class="general-container who-we-are-container"><div class="text-block-9">Who We Are</div><p>A Class-A General Contractor with a vetted team of proven commercial roofing experts in OKC. Each member of our team is an industry leader in their specific discipline, and we are certified in every type of commercial roofing system.</p></div><div class="general-container"><div class="red-text text-block-9">Our Specialties</div><div class="h5 tinified gray-text mobile">Large-Loss insurance | Troubled Insurance Claims | Denied Insurance Claims</div></div></div></div></section><section id="commercialAdvantage" class="section-copy commercial-advantage-copy _5-column-flex"><div class="grid-2-5 commercial-advantage-image"></div><div class="grid-3-5"><div class="left-column-content commercial-advantage"><div class="h2 vertical-flex padding-bottom-none align-left mobile"><span class="gray-text">Our</span> Advantage</div><div class="gray-text secondary-title">Our ability to build an impactful case for customer advocacy</div><div class="red-line-cushion-box"><div class="red-line-long"></div></div><p>This is hands down what makes Salazar the unmatched leader in commercial roofing. This advocacy effort is grounded in thorough policy review with a trained eye for identifying key policy language. We understand proper claim documentation and we are skilled in satisfying the ‘Burden Of Proof’ for the claim. We are in partnership with Public Adjusters, Engineers, and Insurance Attorneys across the country. We back our clients with expert-level claim negotiation and appraisal representation as warranted.</p></div></div></section><section id="commercialGreat" class="section commercial-great bottom-border-section light-gray-bg"><div class="bottom-border-copy commercial-copy"><div class="flex-container fixed-height width-60 centered commercial"><div class="flex-half align-right border-right additional-padding-left-half fixed-height commercial"><h2 class="h2 vertical-flex gray-text align-right mobile">TRUSTED FOR<br/>  <span class="black-text">A REASON</span></h2></div><div class="flex-half additional-padding-right-half fixed-height commercial"><p class="what-we-are-great-at-text">We leverage our resources to make the most of yours, and advocate for you through the whole process.</p><a href="/contact" class="tinified-link">CONTACT A SALAZAR REPRESENTATIVE</a></div></div></div></section><div class="section certified-cta light-gray-bg cta-main"><div class="half-flex centered mobile certified-cta"><h2 class="cta-title">WE ARE CERTIFIED BY THE BEST.<br/></h2><p class="cta-text">We maintain certifications with the best material manufacturers in the industry, and complete regular installation training, testing, and ongoing education. Our top-notch partnerships help us provide our well-known fast turnaround times.</p><div class="multi-image-container mobile-cta"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/613b7c85d78c380f2beb5db8_SR_GAF_235.png" loading="lazy" alt="GAF Logo" class="flex-image gaf"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/613b7ca2cc430e865edd97ff_SR_certainTeed_700.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/613b7ca2cc430e865edd97ff_SR_certainTeed_700-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/613b7ca2cc430e865edd97ff_SR_certainTeed_700.png 700w" alt="CertainTeed Logo" class="flex-image certainteed"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/613b7cb5c8202126408ad209_SR_berridge2_225.png" loading="lazy" alt="Berridge Logo" class="flex-image berridge"/><div id="w-node-cb3baa86-6d0e-4323-73c5-013287f68942-e5b69990" class="mobile-spacer"></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/613b7ce5d78c388294eb6280_SR_duro-last_525.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/613b7ce5d78c388294eb6280_SR_duro-last_525-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/613b7ce5d78c388294eb6280_SR_duro-last_525.png 525w" alt="Duro Last Logo" class="flex-image duro-last"/><div id="w-node-f79e5f90-9c4d-61a2-b2c0-8a70bc8fc37e-e5b69990" class="mobile-spacer"></div></div></div></div><div class="w-embed w-iframe"><iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d12991.35536399928!2d-97.740485!3d35.508263!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x87b206335ff246e5%3A0x6602c9418c5a0b7!2sSalazar%20Roofing!5e0!3m2!1sen!2snp!4v1708920507105!5m2!1sen!2snp" width="100%" height="450" style="border:0; display: block;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe></div><div class="section foooter"><div class="footer-nav"><div class="h6 white-text foooter-nav-items"><a href="/residential-roofing-contractors-okc" class="footer-nav-link">Residential</a></div><div class="h6 white-text foooter-nav-items"><a h